# 语言扫一遍（西班牙文）：游戏语言当作在选项页选了 es（DM_TEST_LANG=2），宿主提示用 es；进局后把总面板的页签都翻一遍、开关暂停页，焦点与面板栈正常、没有红标
# Language sweep (es): the game language as if es had been chosen on the options page (DM_TEST_LANG=2), host dialogs in es; in a run flip through every tab of the combined panel and open and close the pause page; focus and the panel stack stay sane, no red markers
name lang_es
save warlock
env DM_TEST_LANG=2 DM_LANG=es
timeout 180

enter_game
press PLUS
expect_state panels~=UISwitcher focus_panel!=None timeout=5
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
expect_state panels~=UISwitcher timeout=5
press B
expect_state focus_panel=None timeout=5
open_pause
close_pause
expect_state panels~=HUDPanel paused=false
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
check event language name=esES
check actions seq=pause,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,back
